OL,3,GNEWSAMum proud of son whose organs
OL,4,Ahelped six strangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe very last text message Rob Riley
OL,7,Fsent his mum contained just four words,
OL,8,Fshort and urgent: " Mum, I need help."
OL,10,FGerry had only briefly popped out of
OL,11,Ftheir home in Leicestershire but when
OL,12,Fshe returned minutes later, she found
OL,13,FRob, struggling to breathe. An
OL,14,Fotherwise ordinary day had suddenly
OL,15,Ftaken a devastating turn.
OL,17,FThe 21-year-old had suffered a severe
OL,18,Fasthma attack, his lungs stopped
OL,19,Fworking and he went into cardiac
OL,20,Farrest.
